    "description": "This NCEI Accession includes discrete sample and profile data collected during the R/V Hudson GO-SHIP AR07W cruise (EXPOCODE 18HU20160430) in the North Atlantic Ocean and Labrador Sea from 2016-04-30 to 2016-05-15. These data include temperature, salinity, dissolved oxygen, nutrients, chlorofluorocarbons, nutrients, dissolved inorganic carbon (DIC), total alkalinity, pH on the total scale, sulfur hexaflouride (SF6) and ammonium.",
